MIT; copyright and full permission notices are retained in areatex.h/searchtex.h.

The generated *.comp shaders come from the retained HLSL sources. Regenerate
and validate them with Python 3 and the Vulkan SDK:
python src/video_core/host_shaders/postfx/convert.py --tools <VulkanSDK/Bin>
Normal emulator builds embed the GLSL sources and need no DXC or Python runtime.
